<title>HONG KONG: Newmax unit launches US$50 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Newmax unit launches US$50 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate note issue was announced by arranger Korea First Finance.</p>
<p> BORROWER    NEWMAX INTERNATIONAL (HK) CO LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTORS  (A) NEWMAX CO LTD</p>
<p>		 (B) TAEIL MEDIA CO</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$50 MLN  COUPON     6ML+90    MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	  ISS PRICE  PAR</p>
<p> PUTS     YR 3	 CALLS	NONE	LAUNCH    25.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING  LUXEMBOURG REPAYMENT  BULLET    REPLIES   10.OCT.96</p>
<p> RATING   --	   SALES LMTS CUSTOMARY DENOMS    US$500K</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	  CRS DEF    YES	 FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH    HOME CTRY  S KOREA   PAY DATE  --</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p> CO-LEAD MGRS   US$5 MLN+   141BP  ALL-IN  137</p>
<p> SENIOR MGRS    US$3-4 MLN  138BP  ALL-IN  136</p>
<p> MANAGERS	 US$1-2 MLN  135BP  ALL-IN  135</p>
<p> ARRANGERS  KOREA FIRST FINANCE, LTCB ASIA, NOMURA SECURITIES  NOTES   TWO OTHER BANKS MAY JOIN THE ARRANGER GROUP</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
